0..65 Comment "//! A product of two sums over free naturals has one normal form,"
66..86 Comment "//! however it sums."
87..90 Comment "//!"
91..170 Comment "//! Grégoire and Leroy normalise the product of 128 plus `x` and 128 plus `y`."
171..237 Comment "//! Its free variables leave matches stuck inside the normal form."
238..241 Comment "//!"
242..306 Comment "//! Each factor runs sixteen successors past a free variable, so"
307..328 Comment "//! the product stops"
329..396 Comment "//! on matches over `x` and `y`. The path writes both products, the"
397..416 Comment "//! right factor of"
417..445 Comment "//! one summed in two steps."
446..449 Comment "//!"
450..530 Comment "//! - cites: [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction], § 6"
531..569 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
570..573 Comment "//!"
574..747 Comment "//! [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction]: https://doi.org/10.1145/581478.581501 \"Grégoire and Leroy, A compiled implementation of strong reduction\""
749..789 Comment "// The free naturals and their addition."
